  {
    "sha": "fb54159861708558b5f5658ebdc14709d984361c",
    "message": "secret key rotation: fix key list ordering\n\nThe `itsdangerous` serializer interface[1] expects keys to be\nprovided with the oldest key at index zero and the active signing key\nat the end of the list.\n\nWe document[2] that `SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS` should be configured with\nthe most recent first (at index zero), so to achieve the expected\nbehaviour, those should be inserted in reverse-order at the head of\nthe list.\n\n[1] - https://itsdangerous.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/serializer/#itsdangerous.serializer.Serializer\n\n[2] - https://flask.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/config/#SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS",
    "date": "2025-03-10T16:34:12Z",
    "is_bug_fix": true,
    "files": [
      {
        "filename": "src/flask/sessions.py",
        "changes": 3,
        "additions": 2,
        "deletions": 1,
        "status": "modified"
      }
    ]
  },
